&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.semrush.com/pricing/ai/"&gt;Semrush AI Visibility Toolkit&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is available to purchase on its own &lt;em&gt;or as an add-on &lt;/em&gt;to an existing Semrush subscription. &lt;strong&gt;Semrush SEO + AI Search&lt;/strong&gt; is also known as &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.semrush.com/pricing/semrush-one/"&gt;Semrush One&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, and it’s the bundled product with SEO and AEO features.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This article (and the quick comparison table below) primarily compares HubSpot AEO and Semrush AI Visibility Toolkit (the products available for purchase on their own). But I’ll also include additional information about AEO in Marketing Hub Professional and Enterprise and Semrush One (the integrated/bundled products).&lt;/p&gt; 
